**That repository carries no licence statement**: no LICENSE file, no
notice in its README, nothing in its commit history. Under the Berne
Convention and the copyright law of essentially every jurisdiction, work
published without a licence is not thereby placed in the public domain —
the author keeps every exclusive right, and a downstream recipient holds
no grant to redistribute or relicense it.

The AGPL grant stated above is therefore made by Tigerblue77 over the
parts of this work that are Tigerblue77's own, which today is most of
